:: StoryTitle
The neighbour who remembers me

:: StoryData
{"ifid":"DB0A0310-85B7-4CDA-A2B0-000000000001","format":"SugarCube","format-version":"2.37.3","start":"Start"}

:: StoryScript [script]
setup.episode={"id":"neighbour","version":1,"title":"The neighbour who remembers me","subtitle":"A greeting becomes a small invitation.","place":"Courtyard","newWords":["邻居","英语","喝茶"],"ending":"I leave with a name, a wave, and something to say next time. The courtyard is the same size. Somehow it feels less anonymous.","scenes":[{"title":"Someone knows my face","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["I step into the courtyard before school. My bag catches the door, which makes a much louder entrance than I intended.","A woman with a canvas shopping bag smiles. This is Ms Lin, the neighbour I have nodded to all week. Today she waits for more than a nod. I want to introduce myself before I have to leave."],"line":{"zh":"你好！你住这里吗？","english":"Hello! Do you live here?","pinyin":"nǐ hǎo ！ nǐ zhù zhè lǐ ma ？","audio":"audio/98af3e919d7b61b3fd08.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"live","label":"Say that I live here","simple":{"chunks":["我","住","这里"],"english":"I live here.","pinyin":["wǒ","zhù","zhè lǐ"],"audio":"audio/5c367bbe062bf83bad1c.m4a"},"response":"Ms Lin points upstairs, then at herself. Two people in one building have finally become neighbours.","hint":"Put the person first, then what they do. Keep the question particle at the end.","rich":{"chunks":["我","也","住","这里"],"english":"I live here too.","pinyin":["wǒ","yě","zhù","zhè lǐ"],"audio":"audio/98503bc1fc8a71f65934.m4a"}},{"id":"greet","label":"Return her greeting","simple":{"chunks":["你好","很高兴","认识你"],"english":"Hello, nice to meet you.","pinyin":["nǐ hǎo","hěn gāo xìng","rèn shi nǐ"],"audio":"audio/48676dd1703d75b42bc3.m4a"},"response":"She shifts the shopping bag to shake my hand. We are officially past the nodding stage.","hint":"Keep the greeting first; 很高兴 belongs before 认识你.","rich":{"chunks":["你好","很高兴","认识你"],"english":"Hello, nice to meet you.","pinyin":["nǐ hǎo","hěn gāo xìng","rèn shi nǐ"],"audio":"audio/48676dd1703d75b42bc3.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Look at her shopping bag","answer":"A spring onion sticks out like a green flag. She notices me looking and tucks it back in. It immediately escapes again."},"id":"exchange-1"},{"title":"A name to remember","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["Ms Lin introduces herself slowly. I repeat her surname once, and she nods.","A scooter rolls past. For a moment I consider letting its engine do all the talking. Instead, I offer my name."],"line":{"zh":"我姓林。你叫什么名字？","english":"My surname is Lin. What is your name?","pinyin":"wǒ xìng lín 。 nǐ jiào shén me míng zì ？","audio":"audio/a061dd6e359f455595dc.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"name","label":"Introduce myself as David","simple":{"chunks":["你好","我","叫","大卫"],"english":"Hello, my name is David.","pinyin":["nǐ hǎo","wǒ","jiào","dà wèi"],"audio":"audio/0f7c2a51028546ed4a9c.m4a"},"response":"“David,” she repeats carefully. She gives my name the same attention I gave hers.","hint":"叫 comes between 我 and the name.","rich":{"chunks":["你好","我","叫","大卫"],"english":"Hello, my name is David.","pinyin":["nǐ hǎo","wǒ","jiào","dà wèi"],"audio":"audio/0f7c2a51028546ed4a9c.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Ask how to address her","answer":"Ms Lin gestures to herself and repeats her surname. “Ms Lin” is a comfortable name for this fictional neighbour; I do not need a complicated title to begin."},"id":"exchange-2"},{"title":"The books give me away","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["She notices the books in my bag and points toward the school gate.","I want to explain my work, not deliver my entire employment history beside a bicycle rack. One clear sentence will do."],"line":{"zh":"你是老师吗？","english":"Are you a teacher?","pinyin":"nǐ shì lǎo shī ma ？","audio":"audio/34510b05e4098c00aa29.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"teacher","label":"Explain that I teach English","simple":{"chunks":["我","是","英语老师"],"english":"I am an English teacher.","pinyin":["wǒ","shì","yīng yǔ lǎo shī"],"audio":"audio/6550f64fef56edd93900.m4a"},"response":"Ms Lin grins and mimes a classroom full of raised hands. I mime a very large cup of coffee. We both understand.","hint":"Use 我 + 是 + the occupation.","rich":{"chunks":["我","在学校","教","英语"],"english":"I teach English at school.","pinyin":["wǒ","zài xué xiào","jiào","yīng yǔ"],"audio":"audio/9df506df76f132bb2d65.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Notice what she remembers","answer":"She remembers seeing me carry books yesterday. It is a small kindness: someone has been paying attention."},"id":"exchange-3"},{"title":"One sentence too fast","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["Her next question comes with a smile, a gesture, and more syllables than I can comfortably hold.","I catch “Chinese.” The rest has already left the station. I could nod, but then I would have agreed to something I do not understand."],"line":{"zh":"你在学中文吗？","english":"Are you learning Chinese?","pinyin":"nǐ zài xué zhōng wén ma ？","audio":"audio/3545c51a32664acc8680.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"repeat","label":"Ask her to say it again","simple":{"chunks":["请","再说","一遍"],"english":"Please say it again.","pinyin":["qǐng","zài shuō","yí biàn"],"audio":"audio/a65bbc3864b52e5a91e4.m4a"},"response":"She repeats the question slowly, without making a performance of my difficulty. This is a conversation, not an exam.","hint":"再 goes before 说; 一遍 tells how many repetitions.","rich":{"chunks":["请","再","说一遍","好吗"],"english":"Could you please say it again?","pinyin":["qǐng","zài","shuō yí biàn","hǎo ma"],"audio":"audio/5b6c7cbc2b8843162ae8.m4a"}},{"id":"slow","label":"Ask her to speak a little slowly","simple":{"chunks":["请","说","慢一点"],"english":"Please speak a little more slowly.","pinyin":["qǐng","shuō","màn yì diǎn"],"audio":"audio/c49dc06bd705315e47ea.m4a"},"response":"She slows down. The words separate themselves into something I can answer.","hint":"慢一点 describes how to speak, so it follows 说.","rich":{"chunks":["请","说","慢一点"],"english":"Please speak a little more slowly.","pinyin":["qǐng","shuō","màn yì diǎn"],"audio":"audio/c49dc06bd705315e47ea.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Recall what I heard","answer":"She is asking whether I am learning Chinese. Asking for repetition keeps the conversation alive; it does not mean I have failed."},"id":"exchange-4"},{"title":"A small honest answer","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["This time I hear the question. Ms Lin waits, balancing her bag on the bicycle seat.","I can say a little. That is different from saying nothing."],"line":{"zh":"你会说中文吗？","english":"Can you speak Chinese?","pinyin":"nǐ huì shuō zhōng wén ma ？","audio":"audio/3ae8c97ebc751b12253a.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"little","label":"Say that I speak a little","simple":{"chunks":["我","会说","一点","中文"],"english":"I can speak a little Chinese.","pinyin":["wǒ","huì shuō","yì diǎn","zhōng wén"],"audio":"audio/529e8289f832c996c0b3.m4a"},"response":"She holds her fingers a little apart, then opens her hand wider: a little can grow.","hint":"一点 belongs before 中文 here.","rich":{"chunks":["我","会说","一点","中文"],"english":"I can speak a little Chinese.","pinyin":["wǒ","huì shuō","yì diǎn","zhōng wén"],"audio":"audio/529e8289f832c996c0b3.m4a"}},{"id":"learning","label":"Say that I am learning","simple":{"chunks":["我","在学","中文"],"english":"I am learning Chinese.","pinyin":["wǒ","zài xué","zhōng wén"],"audio":"audio/4416b585e931878bec85.m4a"},"response":"She nods toward herself as if volunteering to be part of the practice.","hint":"在学 means “am learning.”","rich":{"chunks":["我","每天","都学","中文"],"english":"I study Chinese every day.","pinyin":["wǒ","měi tiān","dōu xué","zhōng wén"],"audio":"audio/b43d4aacfcc612316c7c.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Ask about her morning","answer":"She points to her shopping bag, then the teahouse. Shopping first, tea later. Her morning has a sensible order."},"id":"exchange-5"},{"title":"Ask something back","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["The clock above the gate reminds me that I still have a job to get to. But I do not want to disappear immediately after talking about myself.","Across the courtyard, a woman is setting cups on a table. Ms Lin waves to her. I can ask about the place or about her plans."],"line":{"zh":"那边可以喝茶。","english":"You can drink tea over there.","pinyin":"nà biān kě yǐ hē chá 。","audio":"audio/7f36a0e34466458f50cc.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"tea","label":"Ask whether she likes tea","simple":{"chunks":["你","喜欢","喝茶","吗"],"english":"Do you like drinking tea?","pinyin":["nǐ","xǐ huan","hē chá","ma"],"audio":"audio/710428c0164320b8ee7a.m4a"},"response":"She laughs and points at her cup-shaped hand. That appears to be a very enthusiastic yes.","hint":"Keep 吗 at the end.","rich":{"chunks":["你","喜欢","喝茶","吗"],"english":"Do you like drinking tea?","pinyin":["nǐ","xǐ huan","hē chá","ma"],"audio":"audio/710428c0164320b8ee7a.m4a"},"flag":"likes-tea"},{"id":"weekend","label":"Ask if she is free on the weekend","simple":{"chunks":["你","周末","有空","吗"],"english":"Are you free on the weekend?","alternatives":[[1,0,2,3]],"pinyin":["nǐ","zhōu mò","yǒu kōng","ma"],"audio":"audio/3d3c39d4c137f7eaef46.m4a"},"response":"She considers, then points to Saturday on her phone. There may be a conversation with more time in it.","hint":"Put 周末 before 有空.","rich":{"chunks":["你","周末","有空","吗"],"english":"Are you free on the weekend?","alternatives":[[1,0,2,3]],"pinyin":["nǐ","zhōu mò","yǒu kōng","ma"],"audio":"audio/3d3c39d4c137f7eaef46.m4a"},"flag":"weekend"}],"aside":{"question":"Look toward the teahouse","answer":"The owner catches our wave. Ms Lin calls her Ms Zhou. I have not met her yet, but I now have another face to recognise."},"id":"exchange-6"},{"title":"An invitation, not a test","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["Ms Lin offers to meet for tea on Saturday. I check the time: I can still reach school without running.","I can accept, or leave the invitation for another day. Either way, I want to answer warmly and clearly."],"line":{"zh":"星期六一起喝茶，好吗？","english":"Shall we have tea together on Saturday?","pinyin":"xīng qī liù yī qǐ hē chá ， hǎo ma ？","audio":"audio/50a566de2d7ff32e254b.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"accept","label":"Accept the invitation","simple":{"chunks":["好","我们","星期六","见"],"english":"Okay, see you on Saturday.","alternatives":[[0,2,1,3]],"pinyin":["hǎo","wǒ men","xīng qī liù","jiàn"],"audio":"audio/9735e389ad83c15ddd52.m4a"},"response":"She taps Saturday on her phone and waves me toward school. I walk away with an actual plan.","hint":"We comes before the meeting time in this version.","rich":{"chunks":["好","我们","星期六","见"],"english":"Okay, see you on Saturday.","alternatives":[[0,2,1,3]],"pinyin":["hǎo","wǒ men","xīng qī liù","jiàn"],"audio":"audio/9735e389ad83c15ddd52.m4a"},"flag":"tea-accepted"},{"id":"decline","label":"Thank her and suggest another day","simple":{"chunks":["谢谢","我们","改天","喝茶"],"english":"Thank you; let’s have tea another day.","pinyin":["xiè xiè","wǒ men","gǎi tiān","hē chá"],"audio":"audio/1e448ec2821bd654e61e.m4a"},"response":"She nods, with no sign of offence. An invitation can stay open without becoming a promise.","hint":"改天 means another day; put it before 喝茶.","rich":{"chunks":["谢谢","我们","改天","喝茶"],"english":"Thank you; let’s have tea another day.","pinyin":["xiè xiè","wǒ men","gǎi tiān","hē chá"],"audio":"audio/1e448ec2821bd654e61e.m4a"},"flag":"tea-later"}],"aside":{"question":"Remember the first greeting","answer":"This morning began with a nod. Now I can introduce myself, explain my work, and ask for help when a sentence is too fast."},"id":"exchange-7"}],"resources":["neighbour.html","courtyard.webp","characters.webp","audio/98af3e919d7b61b3fd08.m4a","audio/5c367bbe062bf83bad1c.m4a","audio/98503bc1fc8a71f65934.m4a","audio/48676dd1703d75b42bc3.m4a","audio/a061dd6e359f455595dc.m4a","audio/0f7c2a51028546ed4a9c.m4a","audio/34510b05e4098c00aa29.m4a","audio/6550f64fef56edd93900.m4a","audio/9df506df76f132bb2d65.m4a","audio/3545c51a32664acc8680.m4a","audio/a65bbc3864b52e5a91e4.m4a","audio/5b6c7cbc2b8843162ae8.m4a","audio/c49dc06bd705315e47ea.m4a","audio/3ae8c97ebc751b12253a.m4a","audio/529e8289f832c996c0b3.m4a","audio/4416b585e931878bec85.m4a","audio/b43d4aacfcc612316c7c.m4a","audio/7f36a0e34466458f50cc.m4a","audio/710428c0164320b8ee7a.m4a","audio/3d3c39d4c137f7eaef46.m4a","audio/50a566de2d7ff32e254b.m4a","audio/9735e389ad83c15ddd52.m4a","audio/1e448ec2821bd654e61e.m4a"]};
/* Presentation only. The parent owns identity, validation, audio and local saves. */
Config.history.maxStates = 1;
Config.history.controls = false;
Config.saves.isAllowed = () => false;
Config.ui.stowBarInitially = true;
Config.passages.nobr = true;
const channel = new URLSearchParams(location.hash.slice(1)).get('channel');
let snapshot = null;
let pending = false;
let hotkeys = ['1','2','3','4','5','6'];
let playKey = 'p';
const characters = {lin:['Ms Lin · my neighbour',0],chen:['Chen · my colleague',1],zhou:['Ms Zhou · teahouse owner',2]};
function send(type, payload = {}) {
  if (parent === window || !channel) return;
  parent.postMessage({protocol:'chunky-game-v1',channel,type,...payload},location.origin);
}
function act(type, extra = {}) { if(pending)return;pending=true;send('action',{revision:snapshot.revision,action:{type,...extra}}); }
function el(tag, text, cls) { const n=document.createElement(tag); if(text!==undefined)n.textContent=text; if(cls)n.className=cls; return n; }
function button(label, fn, key) { const b=el('button',label); b.type='button'; b.onclick=fn; if(key)b.dataset.key=key; return b; }
function speak(audio) { if(audio)send('audio',{audio}); }
function zhLine(line, root) {
  const p=el('p',line.zh,'chinese'); p.lang='zh-CN'; root.append(p);
  if(snapshot.pinyin)root.append(el('p',line.pinyin,'pinyin'));
  root.append(button('▶ Hear Mandarin',()=>speak(line.audio),'hear'));
  root.append(button(snapshot.meaning?'Hide meaning':'Show meaning',()=>act('meaning'),'meaning'));
  if(snapshot.meaning)root.append(el('p',line.english,'translation'));
}
function render(root) {
  root.replaceChildren();
  if (!snapshot) { root.append(el('p',parent===window?'Open this episode from Game in Chunky Chinese to save your progress.':'Opening your conversation…')); return; }
  const a=snapshot, ep=setup.episode, scene=ep.scenes[a.step];
  if(!scene) {
    root.append(el('p','EPISODE COMPLETE','eyebrow'),el('h1','Things I can now say'),el('p',ep.ending));
    a.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const c=ep.scenes[i].choices.find(c=>c.id===r.choiceId),ans=c[a.variant];const card=el('section',undefined,'receipt');const line=el('p',ans.chunks.join(''),'chinese');line.lang='zh-CN';card.append(line,el('p',ans.english),el('small',r.independent?'Independently':'With support'),button('▶ Hear my sentence',()=>speak(ans.audio)));root.append(card)});
    root.append(el('p','Recognition guides difficulty; these conversations do not change your flashcard ratings.'),button('Back to Game',()=>send('exit'),'exit'));
    return;
  }
  const char=characters[scene.speaker];
  const c=scene.choices.find(c=>c.id===a.choiceId);
  const art=el('div',undefined,'scene-art');
  const portrait=el('img',undefined,'portrait');portrait.src='characters.webp';portrait.alt='';portrait.style.setProperty('--person',char[1]);portrait.onerror=()=>portrait.remove();
  // A clipped atlas shows only the current interlocutor, with their name as fallback.
  const crop=el('div',undefined,'portrait-crop');crop.append(portrait);art.append(crop,el('span',ep.place,'place'));root.append(art);
  const panel=el('section',undefined,'dialogue');
  panel.append(el('p',`${a.step+1} / ${ep.scenes.length} · ${char[0]}`,'eyebrow'));
  const heading=el('h1',scene.title);heading.tabIndex=-1;panel.append(heading);
  if(scene.callback && a.callbacks.includes(scene.callback.flag))panel.append(el('p',scene.callback.text,'callback'));
  // Assistive technology gets the full narrative immediately; visual pacing is optional.
  if(c){const moment=el('details');moment.append(el('summary','Recall this moment'),el('p',scene.paragraphs.join(' ')));panel.append(moment)}
  else {const sr=el('div',scene.paragraphs.join(' '),'sr-only');panel.append(sr);
  scene.paragraphs.slice(0,a.paragraph+1).forEach(t=>{const p=el('p',t);p.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');panel.append(p)})}
  if(a.paragraph<scene.paragraphs.length) {
    panel.append(button('Next',()=>act('reveal'),'next'),button('Show all',()=>act('showAll'),'showAll'));root.append(panel);return;
  }
  zhLine(scene.line,panel);
  panel.append(button(a.pinyin?'Pinyin: on':'Pinyin: off',()=>act('pinyin'),'pinyin'));
  const aside=el('section',undefined,'aside');aside.append(button(scene.aside.question,()=>act('aside'),'aside'));if(a.aside)aside.append(el('p',scene.aside.answer));if(!c)panel.append(aside);
  const recall=el('details');recall.append(el('summary','Recall the conversation'));
  a.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const s=ep.scenes[i],c=s.choices.find(c=>c.id===r.choiceId);recall.append(el('p',`${s.line.zh} — ${c[a.variant].chunks.join('')}`),el('p',c.response))});
  if(!a.results.length)recall.append(el('p',scene.paragraphs.join(' ')));if(!c)panel.append(recall);
  if(!c) {
    panel.append(el('h2','What do I want to say?'));
    scene.choices.forEach((choice,i)=>{const b=button(`${i+1}. ${choice.label}`,()=>act('choose',{choiceId:choice.id}),`choice-${i}`);b.dataset.shortcut=hotkeys[i];panel.append(b)});
  } else {
    const answer=c[a.variant];
    panel.append(el('h2',c.label),el('p',answer.english,'intention'));
    const selected=el('div',undefined,'sentence');selected.setAttribute('aria-label','My sentence');
    a.tiles.forEach((id,pos)=>{const b=button(answer.chunks[id],()=>act('remove',{index:pos}),`remove-${pos}`);b.lang='zh-CN';b.disabled=a.solved;b.setAttribute('aria-label',`Remove ${answer.chunks[id]}`);selected.append(b)});
    if(!a.tiles.length)selected.append(el('span','Tap chunks below to build your reply.','empty'));panel.append(selected);
    const bank=el('div',undefined,'chunks');bank.setAttribute('aria-label','Available chunks');
    const order=answer.chunks.map((_,i)=>i).reverse();
    order.forEach((id,pos)=>{const b=button('',()=>act('tile',{index:id}),`tile-${id}`);b.disabled=a.tiles.includes(id)||a.solved;b.dataset.shortcut=hotkeys[pos];b.append(el('small',String(pos+1)),el('span',answer.chunks[id]));b.lang='zh-CN';if(a.pinyin)b.append(el('small',answer.pinyin[id]));bank.append(b)});panel.append(bank);
    const controls=el('div',undefined,'controls');
    if(!a.solved) {
      controls.append(button('Undo',()=>act('undo'),'undo'),button('Clear',()=>act('clear'),'clear'),button('Hint',()=>act('hint'),'hint'),button('Check',()=>act('check'),'check'));
      if(a.errors>=2)controls.append(button('Show worked answer',()=>act('model'),'model'));
    }
    panel.append(controls);
    if(a.feedback){const f=el('p',a.feedback,'feedback');f.setAttribute('role','status');panel.append(f)}
    if(a.solved){panel.append(el('p',c.response,'response'),button('▶ Hear my reply',()=>speak(answer.audio),'reply'),button(a.step===ep.scenes.length-1?'Finish episode':'Continue',()=>act('next'),'continue'))}
    panel.append(el('small','Keys 1–5 choose chunks. Tab moves between controls. P replays the speaker.','keyboard-help'));
  }
  if(c){const more=el('details');more.append(el('summary','More conversation & recall'),aside,recall);panel.append(more)}
  root.append(panel);
}
Macro.add('chengduScene',{handler:function(){const root=el('main',undefined,'chengdu');this.output.append(root);render(root)}});
window.addEventListener('message',event=>{
  const m=event.data;
  if(event.source!==parent||event.origin!==location.origin||m?.protocol!=='chunky-game-v1'||m.channel!==channel||m.type!=='state'||!m.state||m.state.episodeId!==setup.episode.id||m.state.version!==setup.episode.version)return;
  pending=false;
  const before=snapshot;
  snapshot=m.state;
  if(Array.isArray(m.hotkeys))hotkeys=m.hotkeys;
  if(typeof m.playKey==='string')playKey=m.playKey;
  const passage=snapshot.step===setup.episode.scenes.length?'Ending':`Scene${snapshot.step+1}`;
  const focusKey=document.activeElement?.dataset?.key;
  if(State.passage!==passage)Engine.play(passage);
  else {const root=document.querySelector('.chengdu');if(root)render(root)}
  if(before && (before.step!==snapshot.step || (!before.choiceId && snapshot.choiceId)))window.scrollTo(0,0);
  if(before){const controls=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button'));const focus=controls.find(b=>b.dataset.key===focusKey&&!b.disabled)||controls.find(b=>b.dataset.key==='continue')||controls.find(b=>b.dataset.shortcut&&!b.disabled)||document.querySelector('h1');focus?.focus({preventScroll:true})}
});
window.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{
  if(event.ctrlKey||event.metaKey||event.altKey||event.repeat||!snapshot)return;
  if(event.key.toLowerCase()===playKey.toLowerCase()){event.preventDefault();speak(setup.episode.scenes[snapshot.step]?.line.audio);return}
  const b=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[data-shortcut]')).find(b=>b.dataset.shortcut?.toLowerCase()===event.key.toLowerCase()&&!b.disabled);
  if(b){event.preventDefault();b.click()}
});
$(document).one(':storyready',()=>send('ready'));


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
:root{color-scheme:light;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#253b32;background:#f5efdf}body{margin:0;background:#f5efdf;color:#253b32}#ui-bar,#story-title{display:none}#story{margin:0;padding:0}#passages{max-width:820px;margin:auto}.passage{padding:0}.chengdu{padding:0 0 24px}.scene-art{height:205px;position:relative;background:#b9c9a3 url('courtyard.webp') center 52%/cover;image-rendering:pixelated;border-bottom:5px solid #37654a;overflow:hidden}.portrait-crop{position:absolute;width:97px;height:194px;bottom:0;right:12%;overflow:hidden}.portrait{height:194px;width:291px;max-width:none;position:absolute;left:calc(var(--person) * -97px);image-rendering:pixelated}.place{position:absolute;left:18px;top:18px;background:#183d30;color:#fff6df;padding:8px 15px;border:2px solid #dbba75;font-weight:700}.dialogue,.chengdu>h1,.chengdu>p,.receipt{margin:0;padding:18px 24px}.dialogue p{line-height:1.65;margin:10px 0}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#456251}.dialogue h1,.chengdu>h1{font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;margin:10px 0 18px}h2{font-size:18px;margin-top:22px}.chinese{font-size:25px!important;line-height:1.6!important;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.pinyin{color:#625540;font-size:15px}.translation,.intention{color:#52634f}.callback{border-left:3px solid #c19850;padding:8px 12px;background:#efe4c9}button{font:inherit;min-height:44px;color:#254332;background:#fffdf7;border:2px solid #9ba991;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px;margin:4px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 0 #c9c5b4}button:hover{background:#eee8cc;border-color:#446e4e}button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b46a27;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}button[data-key=check],button[data-key=continue],button[data-key=next]{background:#285d42;color:#fff;border-color:#285d42}.sentence{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;min-height:72px;background:#eee7d4;border:2px dashed #a2ad94;border-radius:12px;padding:9px;margin:12px 0}.sentence button{font-size:23px;margin:2px}.empty{font-size:14px;color:#6b745f}.chunks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}.chunks button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;min-width:68px;font-size:23px}.chunks small{font-size:12px;color:#59654b}.feedback{background:#e7ead7;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.response{border-left:4px solid #b9853a;padding:12px}.aside{margin-top:16px}details{margin:12px 0;font-size:14px}summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:32px}.receipt{border-top:1px solid #c5cab8}.receipt small{display:inline-block;color:#47624a}.keyboard-help{display:block;color:#68715f;margin-top:14px}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:460px){.dialogue{padding:16px}.scene-art{height:165px}.portrait-crop{right:8%;height:154px;width:77px}.portrait{height:154px;width:231px;left:calc(var(--person) * -77px)}.dialogue h1{font-size:22px}.chunks button{font-size:21px;padding:8px;min-width:56px}.keyboard-help{display:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}

.scene-art{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}.dialogue>button{font-size:13px;padding:8px 10px}.dialogue details{margin:6px 0}.dialogue h1{margin-bottom:10px}@media(max-width:460px){.scene-art{height:125px}.portrait-crop{height:120px;width:60px}.portrait{height:120px;width:180px;left:calc(var(--person) * -60px)}.dialogue{padding:12px 16px}.dialogue h1{font-size:20px}.dialogue p{margin:6px 0}.dialogue h2{margin-top:14px}.place{padding:5px 10px;top:12px;left:12px;font-size:12px}}

/* SugarCube’s stowed sidebar otherwise reserves a left gutter on phones. */
#story,#ui-bar.stowed~#story{margin:0!important;padding:0!important}#passages{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}#ui-bar-tray{display:none!important}


